    "title": "METS mobility bus collides with van in Evansville - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Ian Young ,\n2 hours ago\nEVANSVILLE, Ind. (WEHT) — A METS mobility bus collided with another vehicle in Evansville.\nDispatch says the incident happened around 3:30 p.m. on Wednesday. The crash took place near Saint George Road and Peters Road.\nOfficials say the van veered off into a ditch and had to be pulled out. No injuries were reported.\nCopyright 2026 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to Eyewitness News (WEHT/WTVW).",
